VUE_APP_API_BASE_URL=/xiaozhi
#1. If you want the web backend to adapt to the mobile browser, please start manager-api first to get the server address (http://LAN_IP:8002/xiaozhi)
#2. In the .env file of manager-mobile, change VITE_SERVER_BASEURL to your own server address, then run 'pnpm dev:h5' to get the H5 page address, and fill it in the VUE_APP_H5_URL below
#3. At this point, when the mobile browser accesses the web page, it will jump to the H5 page adapted for the mobile browser
VUE_APP_H5_URL=